  "notes": "よ is used to assert or emphasize information.\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n1. Assertion: ⟦{知|し}っ→知る：00458_shiru⟧てるよ (I know [assertive])\n2. New information: ⟦{電車|でんしゃ}→電車：00522_densha⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{来|き}た→来る：00254_kuru⟧よ (The train has come!)\n3. Emphasis: ⟦{本当|ほんとう}→本当：00779_hontou⟧だよ (It's true!)\n4. Advice/urging: ⟦{食|た}べ→食べる：00396_taberu⟧なよ (Go ahead and eat)\n\nCONTRAST: よ vs ⟦ね→ね：09474_ne⟧\n- よ: asserts information the listener may not know\n- ⟦ね→ね：09474_ne⟧: seeks agreement, confirms shared knowledge\n\nCOMBINATION: よ⟦ね→ね：09474_ne⟧\n- Combines assertion with seeking agreement: そうだよ⟦ね→ね：09474_ne⟧ (That's right, you know?)",
